        "key": "agathaweb-summary-reflection-8b9ab178-4bd2-44d9-b56f-fb4500011c23",
        "text": "We've learned how **HTML** builds the *bones* of Agatha's website, organizing her potions and welcome message!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/37ae25371944d91ce195a1084e9b8602-agathaweb-summary-reflection-panel-1-a0e3b51c-1326-469d-b0d8-2b30f205b60f.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-left"
      },
      {
        "key": "agathaweb-summary-reflection-d4809738-e9f8-47fd-83de-74e91caea88a",
        "text": "Then, **CSS** swooped in like a spell, transforming those bones into a vibrant, enchanting storefront with colors, fonts, and even an image!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/c43a5dafa257cd6be2ea9060d6552ce0-agathaweb-summary-reflection-panel-2-2b477654-d51e-462e-acab-47ce6786c956.png",
        "layout": "text-top-center"
      },
      {
        "key": "agathaweb-summary-reflection-04e3e877-33c3-4453-835f-ae874b51d6cc",
        "text": "From simple text to a beautifully styled shop with an image, we've helped Agatha craft her first magical online presence!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/bbf6d8d05cae6c412d4d7be2b38cb0e0-agathaweb-summary-reflection-panel-3-34353508-0946-4e8c-8681-6cafcdd1bda4.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-center"
      },
      {
        "key": "agathaweb-summary-reflection-b8a376a9-2fe3-41c0-8456-e5ac6b5b0468",
        "text": "This is just the beginning! Agatha can now imagine adding more potion details, customer reviews, or even a magical shopping cart!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/af640f07e69e6019ca761646a8ee94f7-agathaweb-summary-reflection-panel-4-7d323caa-6176-4427-99b4-728edd387203.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      }
